4. **Avoiding starvation** – Because writers always win when they arrive, they cannot be permanently blocked by an unbounded number of readers; each writer will eventually obtain exclusive access once all existing readers have released their read locks.
5. **Error handling** – The code returns `-1` on failure of any system call (`pthread_*`) but does not abort; callers should check for this error code.

